// A shaker screen sorts by size. Gravel and copper ore tipped onto the top of a gentle (1-in-4) iron screen:
// the gravel is finer than the mesh and drops straight through into the pit under it; the ore lumps lie on
// the grating, which grips too well for that slope. Throw the lever: copperline current along the screen
// works its knocker, the grip goes, and the ore walks down the screen and off its end into the far pit. No
// ore ends up with the gravel, and no gravel with the ore. The screen itself holds (it is built, resting on
// the rock at its top and a post at its foot). The lever stands in a niche by the top; the mole watches from a
// pocket under the pit.
map
##################################################
#................................................#
#................................................#
#................................................#
#..........HHHHH.................................#
######....##...HHHHH.............................#
######....#........HHHHH.........................#
######....#............HHHH......................#
###########..............##......................#
###########..............##......................#
###########..............##......................#
##################################################
##################################################
#############.....################################
#############.....################################
#############.....################################
#############.@...################################
##################################################
end
give CopperWire 20
device 2 -8 -12 Lever
wire 2 -8 -12 12 -12
drop 5 Gravel -1 -15
drop 5 CopperOre 0 -15
drop 15 Gravel 0 -15
drop 15 CopperOre -1 -15
drop 25 Gravel -1 -15
drop 25 CopperOre 0 -15
expect 120 zone:Gravel,-3,10,-11,-6 == 3       // the gravel dropped through, into the pit under the screen
expect 120 zone:CopperOre,-3,1,-14,-12 == 3    // the ore lies on the top of the screen
expect 120 shaking:2,-11 == 0
expect 120 static:Screen == 19
use 130 -8 -12                                 // lever on: the screen shakes
expect 131 shaking:2,-11 == 1
expect 400 zone:CopperOre,13,34,-8,-6 == 3     // the ore walked off the end into the far pit
expect 400 zone:CopperOre,-14,12,-16,-1 == 0
expect 400 zone:Gravel,13,34,-16,-1 == 0
expect 400 zone:Gravel,-3,10,-11,-6 == 3
expect 400 static:Screen == 19
